Subject: Execute.getVMSLogicals: today's SHOW LOGICAL layout

<property environment> and anything else that reads the environment found
nothing on OpenVMS: the parser expected lines starting with two spaces and
a quote, and today's SHOW LOGICAL indents with three and adds the table
name: '   "SYS$LOGIN" = "DISK$USER:[me]" (LNM$JOB_...)'. The lines are now
matched with any indent, an optional [attributes] and (table), and doubled
quotes in a value are undone. NOTES N6.

